(Abstract) Tj
T*
(Periodontal inflammation is implicated in systemic vascular pathology through multiple) Tj
T*
(inflammatory pathways. While periodontal intervention improves local tissue health and) Tj
T*
(endothelial function, its effects on larger arterial hemodynamics remain) Tj
T*
(undercharacterized. This randomized trial will compare two evidence-based periodontal) Tj
T*
(treatment approaches regarding their impact on common carotid artery hemodynamic) Tj
T*
(properties. Enrollment targets 40 adults with active periodontal inflammation requiring) Tj
T*
(therapeutic intervention. One arm receives conventional subgingival debridement; the) Tj
T*
(parallel arm receives identical debridement plus adjunctive photobiomodulation therapy.) Tj
T*
(Serial vascular assessments at baseline, immediate post-treatment, and 20-week intervals) Tj
T*
(will measure arterial wall tension dynamics, blood rheology, and elastic properties.) Tj
T*
(Clinical periodontal parameters will be monitored throughout. This study addresses whether) Tj
T*
(combining mechanical and light-based modalities produces superior vascular adaptation) Tj
T*
(compared to mechanical therapy alone.) Tj
